# NYRA Commit Message Guidelines:
# 
# 1. Use the imperative mood: "Add feature" not "Added feature"
# 2. Don't end the subject line with a period
# 3. Capitalize the subject line
# 4. Separate subject from body with a blank line
# 5. Use the body to explain what and why vs. how
# 6. Reference issues and pull requests liberally after the first line
# 
# Examples:
# feat(core): add mortgage calculation API endpoint
# fix(webapp): resolve authentication redirect loop
# docs(readme): update installation instructions for UV
# refactor(secrets): migrate from pyenv to UV package management
